This source is the technical supplement for the presentation-only contribution An Auditable Theory Compiler for AI-Assisted Formal Mathematics, whose
single primary artifact is the two-page source submission_abstract.tex. This
file is subordinate technical support, not a competing submission title. The final
source-level packaging convention used throughout both sources is the following:
the primary CICM presentation-only article is submission_abstract.tex; this
file, main.tex, is the selected technical supplement; theorem_inventory.json
is the selected bounded theorem-obligation inventory; and review_bundle/ is
the selected exact supplemental support directory. No archival replacement is
