statement-only, code-only, mechanical, compression-only, or classifier-scored material without the pinned certificate, ledger, lineage, and boundary rows; this is
type 4. Finally, if the failing field is the boundary field B, the record either raises
path-verified evidence to command-run strength without command, source commit, environment, exit code, and log path, or omits the explicit no-command-run
boundary; this is type 5.
The preceding paragraph exhausts the schema fields: K and l reduce to the
