have the required schema shape. The matching assertions about JSON mirrors,
pass-record files, manifest entries, and verifier logs are supplemental-record assertions and require the named review_bundle/ files to be present. The evidence
surface Ei is a finite list of submission-local files, review-bundle records, pinned
