the explicit marker that the case row does not itself cross a new route boundary.
The pass-record field Ri names the finite gate records used by the row: sourceinterface extraction and consistency for a1 , package and submission-pack records
for a2 , promotion for a3 , overlap and submission-state for a4 , theorem-content
and discovery gating for a5 , and artifact status plus limitation-ledger gating for
a6 .
