and case-snapshot propositions identify the two support functions of the bundle:
a pinned discovery-gate source snapshot and bounded case-evidence snapshots.
Since the primary note states only the interface and each support claim is tied to
a specific theorem, table, or manifest field, the artifacts remain role-separated:
the support materials make the primary note reviewable but do not become
hidden primary claims.

