Proposition 18 (Formal-source gate instantiation). For the current presentation package, the Lean-facing assertions in rows pc 3 and pc 4 of Table 8 are accepted only as bounded contextual interfaces, not as accepted formalsource claims. The accepted certificate surface is the traceability row a1 , the fakeextension boundary row a5 , Table 1, so ur ce _i nt er fa ce _r ec or d. js on ,
