stated in rows pc 3 and pc 4 . They do not certify a fresh Lean build, a current
full-source marker audit, an absence-of-axioms theorem, or an accepted axiompurity pass for the whole newmath tree. Conversely, a Lean-facing sentence in
this package can become a current accepted formal-source claim exactly by adding
an accepted formal-source certificate row with build-gate and axiom-purity-gate
pass records; if the sentence asserts freshness or currency of an execution, the row
must also include the command, source commit or local state, environment, exit
