and the boundary excluding fresh reruns. The certificate constructor and the
schema verifier never query any other coordinate of a review state; equivalently,
these are exactly the artifact coordinates of the finite set F from Theorem 3.
They therefore build the same tuple (K, l, E, H, R, D, B) for W and for W ' ,
and Proposition 6 returns the same accepted bounded-artifact decision in both
