certificate. To make such an assertion load-bearing, the package would have to
add a new finite coordinate: an artifact pass record for the asserted semantic
property, or a command-run tuple recording the relevant evaluator execution.
This proves manifest-record invariance for the finite-witness manifest interface
and shows that the theorem is only a finite-record boundary result for row a6
and the coordinate set Ma6 , not an artifact-validation theorem.
