the theorem.
The three cases are mutually exclusive as record modes for a fixed submitted
claim: the first uses the selected directory, the second uses a byte-identical archive
representative, and the third replaces the package state and digest record by a
new common certificate. If a proposed support reading is in none of the modes, it
contributes no coordinate read by the verifier. By Theorem 3 and the obstruction
