manual submitted theorem-ledger coordinate a7 . In P7+ , the theorem-obligation
ledger is no longer a detached review-only artifact: the submitted finite support surface contains th eo re m_ in ve nt or y. js on through the manifest field
th eo re m_ in ve nt or y and through acceptance-ledger entry a7 . The earlier
